    },
    "CardDescription": {
        "ParentObjectID": "fl_bone_mounds",
        "LocalizationKey": "Forest_Lore_BoneMounds_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "Bones are heaped against the walls of this chamber in long mounds: long bones stacked like firewood, skulls set in rows along the top, the older layers sunk and gone grey. Whoever came here brought their dead down into the dark and left them. Most of what could be carried off has been, but the lower heaps have never been turned."
    },
